{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-57531","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67272","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-57532","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67273","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-57533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67274","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-57534","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67275","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-57535","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-57536","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67276","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-57537","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67277","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-57538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67278","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-67279","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-67280","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-67281","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-67282","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-67283","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-67284","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-67285","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-67286","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-67287","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57539","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67288","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-57540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67289","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-67290","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-67291","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-67292","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57541","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67293","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-57542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67294","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-67295","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-67296","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-67297","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57543","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67298","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-57544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67299","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-67300","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-67301","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-67302","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57545","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67303","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-57546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67304","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-67305","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-67306","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-67307","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-57547","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-67308","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-57548","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67309","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-67310","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-67311","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-67312","text":", "},{"id":"spn-67313","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-67314","text":", "},{"id":"spn-67315","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-67316","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-57549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67317","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-67318","text":": "},{"id":"spn-67319","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-67320","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-57551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67321","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-67322","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-57553","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67323","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-67324","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-67325","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-67326","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-67327","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-67328","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-57555","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67329","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-67330","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-67331","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-67332","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-57557","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67333","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-67334","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-67335","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-67336","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-57559","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-67337","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-67338","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-67339","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-67340","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-67341","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-67342","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-57561","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera4fkaeceohtrmlucawbt7twm3pfylblupu54lpshngurjdicxj45q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}